<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Licences of the crates linked into typy</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 60rem;
       margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Licences of the crates linked into typy</h1>
<p>The <code>typy</code> executable links the Rust crates below. Each
licence is followed by the crates it covers. Where a crate offers a choice
of licences, the one shown is the one TyPy uses it under.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li>{{name}}: {{count}} crates</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
<h3>{{name}}</h3>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
